After inserting 15 at position 2: 10 -> 15 -> 20 -> 30 -> NULL
After inserting 5 at position 1: 5 -> 10 -> 15 -> 20 -> 30 -> NULL
After inserting 40 at end: 5 -> 10 -> 15 -> 20 -> 30 -> 40 -> NULL
```

