   - Deletes 40.  
   - List becomes: `10 -> 20 -> 30 -> NULL`.

2. Call `deleteAtEnd()`  
   - Traverses to 20.  
   - Deletes 30.  
   - List becomes: `10 -> 20 -> NULL`.

3. Call `deleteAtEnd()`  
